# Depth-budget corpus, FUNCTION-ARGUMENT recursion (G5 termination
# clause). 1500 nested upper() calls: function arguments evaluate through
# arg.unify rather than the unite dispatcher, so this is the shape that
# exercises withDepth (ts/src/unify.ts) rather than the dispatcher
# check. Past the shared budget of 1000, so both engines must report
# unify_cycle. See test/spec/budget.tsv.
